Subject: [PATCH] fix(naturebench): support Kimi K3 low-effort smoke runs

- explicit NatureBench provider selection: gpt-5.6-luna keeps the Luna Responses relay; k3-256k uses the OpenAI-compatible client (direct or via the host-held Kimi Unix-socket relay)
- k3/k3-256k recognized as Kimi-family in model profiles; configured reasoning_effort sent on every request type
- startup validation and candidate metadata generalize to the selected profile; Luna/xhigh default unchanged
- new smoke profile config/naturebench_kimi_k3_256k_smoke.yaml and regression tests
- reports/naturebench_kimi_k3_smoke: live k3-256k/low end-to-end SMLM smoke evidence (COMPLETE, aggregate_improvement=-0.03523989460483358)
